火山留着，凯罗扔出去
I say we keep the volcano, and just throw Carol out onto the street!

9
00:01:24,140 --> 00:01:25,620
凯罗，对不起
Carol, we're all sorry.

10
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:28,260
杰夫的法学院入学面试提早了
It's just that Jeff's law school interview got moved up a week.

11
00:01:28,914 --> 00:01:32,449
-这种事常有 -行了，我已经尽了力打扫
- These things happen. - Well, I've cleaned it up as best I could.

12
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:34,620
还有灰尘的话，就去告我吧!
If he finds any soot in his bed, he can sue me!

13
00:01:35,420 --> 00:01:38,660
杰夫怕有23岁了
Boy, Jeff must be 23 by now?

14
00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:41,300
他家搬到俄亥俄州后就没见过
I don't think we've seen him since Fred and Doris moved to Ohio...

15
00:01:41,340 --> 00:01:43,060
-有5，6年了吧？ -是啊
- what, five, six years ago? - Yeah.

16
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:45,820
不知道杰夫的牙齿问题怎样了
Hope they've resolved that situation with his teeth.

17
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:49,960
对!我记起来了
Oh, yeah! Now, I remember this guy!

18
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:52,820
“嗨，我是杰夫”
"Hi! I'm Jeff! "

19
00:01:56,141 --> 00:01:59,141
够了!杰夫是个好孩子 现在过来住
Can it, you guys! Now, Jeff's a nice boy and while he's in our house...

20
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:01,300
我们要把他当作一家人
I expect you to treat him like one of the family.

21
00:02:03,660 --> 00:02:05,540
最好把他当作人看待
Better yet, treat him like a human being.

22
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:10,160
-恐怕他来了 -不必起来
- Probably him. - No, please, don't get up!

23
00:02:10,340 --> 00:02:13,360
我很乐意为家人做事
I rather enjoy doing all the work in the house.

24
00:02:14,420 --> 00:02:15,540
凯罗，对别人好一点
Carol, be nice.

25
00:02:16,580 --> 00:02:19,760
爸爸!我什么时候对别人不.
Come on, Dad! When have you ever known me not to be...

26
00:02:21,420 --> 00:02:24,560
-好! -凯罗？
- nice. - Carol?

27
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:27,940
女大十八变!
Boy, somebody's really grown up!

28
00:02:29,441 --> 00:02:32,111
牙齿也变了
And somebody's really been to an orthodontist.

29
00:02:35,140 --> 00:02:38,500
毕业后我去了南美洲旅行
Well, after I graduated, I decided to do some traveling in South America.

30
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:42,960
-谈谈见闻吧! -参加里约的狂欢节.
- Give us the highlights! - Well, I went to Carnival in Rio...

31
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:47,180
接着在安第斯攀岩 后来在波哥大得了痢疾
then I did some rock-climbing in the Andes, and then I got dysentery in Bogota!

32
00:02:49,300 --> 00:02:51,540
真是令人神往!
That sounds fascinating!

33
00:02:53,980 --> 00:02:55,840
你显然没得过痢疾
You've obviously never had dysentery.

34
00:02:57,720 --> 00:03:00,180
说说巴西好吗？我一直很想去
So, tell us about Brazil, Jeff? I've always wanted to go there.

35
00:03:00,238 --> 00:03:03,306
太棒了，她的人民，历史，文化
It was spectacular. The people, the history, the culture.

36
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:05,940
我听说有许多天体海滩
I hear they got a lot of nude beaches there.

37
