麦克，天体海滩没什么意思
Nude beaches aren't so great, Mike.

39
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,760
是啊，不穿衣服钥匙放哪？
Yeah, where are you supposed to keep your keys?

40
00:03:14,420 --> 00:03:15,800
可以挂在.
You can hang them on your--

41
