Hey, I'm not getting stuck with Ben again.

45
00:03:27,180 --> 00:03:28,860
他回答不出问题就会生气
When he doesn't know the answer, he gets huffy.

46
00:03:29,060 --> 00:03:30,060
我没有!
I do not!

47
00:03:31,620 --> 00:03:33,160
本，我和你一队
Okay, Ben, I'll be on your team.

48
00:03:33,420 --> 00:03:35,720
我又要带爸爸了
Oh, great! Now I have to carry Dad again.

49
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:39,440
等一下，杰夫是客，理应先挑
Wait a minute, Jeff's our guest. He should get to pick.

50
00:03:39,980 --> 00:03:42,740
-杰夫，你挑 -好，问个问题
- Yeah, Jeff, you pick! - Okay, one question:

51
00:03:43,815 --> 00:03:47,156
<格列佛游记>的作者是谁？ 硫磺酸的方程式是什么？
Who wrote Gulliver's Tra vels, what's the chemical formula for sulfuric acid...

52
00:03:47,220 --> 00:03:48,480
还有火地岛在哪？
and wheres Tierra del Fuego?

53
