全班男同学都跟她有“男女关系”
And I bet every boy in your class had the same "relationship."

61
00:04:25,657 --> 00:04:27,724
不是的!我是不同的
No! I was different!

62
00:04:28,020 --> 00:04:31,040
只有我才能情节她的仓鼠笼子
I was the only guy allowed to clean out the hamster cage.

63
00:04:32,220 --> 00:04:35,180
-也不是好差事 -笼子在她家
- Sounds pretty torrid. - it was in her apartment.

64
