因为被我撞到的人都会不省人事!
Because when I hit them, I put them to sleep!

72
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:14,760
-本，打什么位置？ -防守拦截
- What position do you play, Ben? - Defensive tackle.

73
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:18,040
不愧是条壮汉？ 体重多少？280？285？
One of the big boys, huh? What do you tip the scales at, 280? 285?

74
00:05:19,144 --> 00:05:20,881
73.5磅
Seventy-three and a half.

75
00:05:21,180 --> 00:05:24,300
