Today he goes against the biggest offensive lineman in the league!

76
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:28,280
“超级珍宝”卢切斯基 137公分，81磅
Yeah, "Jumbo Jimbo" Luzetski. 46", 81 pounds.

77
00:05:28,687 --> 00:05:31,823
