若是她真的死了，赶回来看比赛吧
Hey, if she's dead when you get there, why don't you swing on by the game?

86
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:57,640
-麦克! -说笑而已
- Mike! - Just kidding.

87
00:05:58,120 --> 00:06:01,020
