- Well, we're about ready. Where's Carol? - You want me to get her for you, Mom?

88
00:06:02,354 --> 00:06:04,262
喂!坏八怪!
Yo! Rhinobreath!

89
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:06,300
谢谢你，麦克
Thank you, Mike.

90
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:09,300
你真是.
Mike, you are such a....

91
00:06:09,980 --> 00:06:10,940
杰夫!
Oh, hi, Jeff!

92
00:06:11,296 --> 00:06:14,273
-嗨! -准备好去看比赛没？
- Hi! - Carol, you ready to go to the game?

93
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,920
我要等香蕉饼凉快下来
I've got to watch my banana bread cool.

94
00:06:18,860 --> 00:06:22,440
我不是物理学家 但我认为它冷却并不需要你
Well, Carol, I'm no physicist, but I think it can manage without you.

95
00:06:23,460 --> 00:06:25,180
爸爸，我不能置之不理
I can't abandon it now, Dad.

96
00:06:25,420 --> 00:06:27,740
我是陪着这块香蕉饼长大的!
I've been with this bread since it was dough!

97
