★他秋天要到纽约念法律大学
And he'll be going to NYU Law School in the fall

124
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:22,600
★我的爱人
The man I love

125
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:25,840
★我的爱人
The man I love

