我也不想一副妈妈的模样.
Hey, I hate to sound like a mother here...

134
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:06,240
但你们是否非得打烂东西才罢休？
but you guys won't be happy until you've broken something, will you?

135
00:09:07,038 --> 00:09:08,741
-不是的 -不
