本，在厅里练习开球!
Okay, Ben. Punting practice is in the living room!

138
00:09:13,478 --> 00:09:16,114
-好! -说笑而已!
- All right! - Joke, Mom, joke!

139
00:09:18,420 --> 00:09:21,200
知道你的女儿今晚有节目吗？
So, have you heard what your daughter has planned for tonight?

140
