杰夫是个大人，她还是个小孩
Jeff's an adult and she's still a child.

153
00:10:11,860 --> 00:10:13,140
瞧瞧
Look at this.

154
00:10:18,760 --> 00:10:19,800
我的妈呀!
Holy cow!

155
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,120
谢谢
Thank you.

156
00:10:39,700 --> 00:10:40,720
谢谢
Thank you.

157
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:44,640
戏真好看，座无虚席
Boy, the show was great. The theater was packed.

158
00:10:44,640 --> 00:10:45,720
橄榄球赛的晚上都是如此
It's always like that on Helmet Night.

159
00:10:49,340 --> 00:10:50,520
谢谢
Thank you.

160
00:10:53,878 --> 00:10:56,684
-她真漂亮 -她还好
- She's very pretty. - She's okay.

161
00:10:57,140 --> 00:10:59,440
她算还好“的话，什么算”漂亮？
If she's only "okay, " I'd like to see your idea of "great."

